#: formcard/AboutKDEPage.qml:78
#, kde-format
msgid "Be Free!"
msgstr "Ka slobodi!"

#: formcard/AboutKDEPage.qml:85
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"KDE is a world-wide community of software engineers, artists, writers, "
"translators and creators who are committed to Free Software development. KDE "
"produces the Plasma desktop environment, hundreds of applications, and the "
"many software libraries that support them.\n"
"\n"
"KDE is a cooperative enterprise: no single entity controls its direction or "
"products. Instead, we work together to achieve the common goal of building "
"the world's finest Free Software. Everyone is welcome to join and contribute "
"to KDE, including you."
msgstr ""
"KDE je svetska zajednica softverskih inženjera, grafičara, pisaca, "
"prevodilaca i stvaralaca posvećenih razvoju slobodnog softvera. KDE stvara "
"okruženje površi Plasma, stotine programa i mnoge softverske biblioteke koje "
"ih podržavaju.\n"
"\n"
"KDE je zajednički poduhvat: nijedan entitet ne upravlja njegovim smerom ni "
"proizvodima. Umesto toga, radimo zajedno na zajedničkom cilju — stvaranju "
"najboljeg slobodnog softvera na svetu. Svi su dobrodošli da se priključe i "
"doprinesu KDE‑u, uključujući i vas."

#: formcard/AboutKDEPage.qml:92 formcard/AboutPage.qml:224
#, kde-format
msgid "Homepage"
msgstr "Domaća stranica"

#: formcard/AboutKDEPage.qml:98
#, kde-format
msgid "Report bugs"
msgstr "Prijavite greške"

#: formcard/AboutKDEPage.qml:107
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Software can always be improved, and the KDE team is ready to do so. "
"However, you - the user - must tell us when something does not work as "
"expected or could be done better.\n"
"\n"
"KDE has a bug tracking system. Use the button below to file a bug, or use "
"the program's About page to report a bug specific to this application.\n"
"\n"
"If you have a suggestion for improvement then you are welcome to use the bug "
"tracking system to register your wish. Make sure you use the severity called "
"\"Wishlist\"."
msgstr ""
"Softver uvek može biti poboljšan, i tim KDE‑a postojano radi na tome. Ipak, "
"vi — korisnik — morate izvestiti programere kada nešto ne radi kako je "
"očekivano, ili može biti urađeno na bolji način.\n"
"\n"
"KDE poseduje sistem za praćenje grešaka. Upotrebite dugme ispod da biste "
"prijavili grešku, ili stranicu o programu da biste prijavili grešku koja se "
"tiče samo ovog programa.\n"
"\n"
"Ukoliko imate predlog za poboljšanje, takođe možete iskoristiti sistem za "
"praćenje grešaka da registrujete svoju želju. Ne zaboravite da tada za "
"ozbiljnost izaberete „Wishlist“ (spisak želja)."

#: formcard/AboutKDEPage.qml:116
#, kde-format
msgid "Report a bug"
msgstr "Prijavi grešku"

#: formcard/AboutKDEPage.qml:121
#, kde-format
msgid "Join us"
msgstr "Pridružite nam se"

#: formcard/AboutKDEPage.qml:127
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"You do not have to be a software developer to be a member of the KDE team. "
"You can join the language teams that translate program interfaces. You can "
"provide graphics, themes, sounds, and improved documentation. You decide!"
msgstr ""
"Ne morate biti programer da biste postali član tima KDE‑a. Možete se "
"pridružiti jezičkim timovima koji prevode programska sučelja. Možete crtati "
"grafiku, teme, snimati zvukove, ili pisati dokumentaciju. Na vama je da "
"odlučite!"

#: formcard/AboutKDEPage.qml:132 formcard/AboutPage.qml:248
#, kde-format
msgid "Get Involved"
msgstr "Uključi se"

#: formcard/AboutKDEPage.qml:139
#, kde-format
msgid "Developer Documentation"
msgstr "Dokumentacija za programere"

#: formcard/AboutKDEPage.qml:145
#, kde-format
msgid "Support us"
msgstr "Podržite nas"

#: formcard/AboutKDEPage.qml:151
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"KDE software is and will always be available free of charge, however "
"creating it is not free.\n"
"\n"
"To support development the KDE community has formed the KDE e.V., a non-"
"profit organization legally founded in Germany. KDE e.V. represents the KDE "
"community in legal and financial matters.\n"
"\n"
"KDE benefits from many kinds of contributions, including financial. We use "
"the funds to reimburse members and others for expenses they incur when "
"contributing. Further funds are used for legal support and organizing "
"conferences and meetings.\n"
"\n"
"We would like to encourage you to support our efforts with a financial "
"donation.\n"
"\n"
"Thank you very much in advance for your support."
msgstr ""
"Softver KDE‑a je dostupan besplatno, i to će uvek biti tako, ali se u "
"njegovo stvaranje ulažu sredstva.\n"
"\n"
"Radi podrške razvoju, zajednica KDE‑a je oformila KDE e.V., neprofitnu "
"organizaciju sa sedištem u Nemačkoj. KDE e.V. predstavlja zajednicu KDE‑a u "
"pravnim i finansijskim pitanjima.\n"
"\n"
"KDE‑u znače raznovrsni vidovi podrške, uključujući i finansijsku. Novčanim "
"sredstvima pokrivamo izdatke nastale tokom doprinošenja, članovima i "
"drugima. Sredstva se takođe koriste za zakonsku zaštitu i organizovanje "
"konferencija i susreta.\n"
"\n"
"Želimo da vas podstaknemo da podržite KDE novčanom donacijom.\n"
"\n"
"Unapred vam se zahvaljujemo na podršci."

